                                "sense_id": "b722984a-5204-33e3-bf61-83d06f83a896",
                                "text": "Deze sensor is zo ingesteld dat hij reageert zodra de drempelwaarde van temperatuur wordt overschreden.",
                                "translation": "This sensor is set to react as soon as the threshold value of temperature is exceeded.",
                                "english": "This sensor is set to react as soon as the threshold value of temperature is exceeded."
